yer (items.json)', 'full-read', 'preliminary', NULL, 'PDF p. 3, item 2.3. Source class: Code (required), blue. Comparator >=: the source writes "is"; its PDF p. 1 frames the Code class as "the minimum standards for accessibility", so the figure is a floor (ADJUDICATION R8). [ASSUMPTION] Lens MOB rests on the source''s PDF p. 1 sentence "a wider turning radius and wider doors are required by many wheelchairs and scooters today", which names exactly the two quantities door width and turning space; a stricter reading of the lens writer''s D-2 rule (the figure''s own words) would move this figure under the owner''s open question AQ-1 (ADJUDICATION F4, 6).', '2026-11-13 22:30', 'session_2026-11-13-edmonton-checklist-pass', '2026-11-13 22:30', 'session_2026-11-13-edmonton-checklist-pass', 'claim', '>=', 0, NULL);
