rs today", which names exactly the two quantities door width and turning space; a stricter reading of the lens writer''s D-2 rule (the figure''s own words) would move this figure under the owner''s open question AQ-1 (ADJUDICATION F4, 6).', '2026-11-13 22:30', 'session_2026-11-13-edmonton-checklist-pass', '2026-11-13 22:30', 'session_2026-11-13-edmonton-checklist-pass', 'claim', '>=', 0, NULL);
